          style="max-width: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Opening Paragraph (SEO Rule: 3-4 lines before list) -->
      <p class="lead">
        The global chemical manufacturing sector is undergoing an unprecedented structural transition driven by green chemistry mandates, consumer preferences, and stringent environmental guidelines. As regulatory pressures around volatile organic compounds (VOCs) intensify, industrial coatings, adhesives, and textile applications are rapidly abandoning old solvent-based technologies. At the heart of this eco-friendly chemical revolution is the acrylic emulsion sector—a highly dynamic, profitable market that offers immense potential for startup entrepreneurs and established chemical manufacturers alike.
      </p>

      <!-- Table of Contents Card -->
      <div class="box" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px; margin: 30px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 8px;">Table of Emulsion Technology Topics</h3>
        <ul style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; margin-bottom: 0;">
